      training sheets, and other real images. If you already have plain Morse text to convert, use the main
      <a class={link} href="/">Morse code translator</a> instead.
    </p>
    <h3 class={h3}>For Historians and Archive Enthusiasts</h3>
    <p>
      Historical military messages, old telegraph material, early government documents and museum documents contain
