    <h2 class={h2}>Image Decoder vs Decoding by Hand</h2>
    <p>
      Reading Morse by eye is a real skill, and a useful one. But when the source is a photo and you just need the
      message, the decoder gets there faster.
    </p>
    <div class="overflow-x-auto">
      <table class={tableClass}>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th class={thClass} scope="col"></th>
